sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Job as Background Worker
    participant API as ML Service API
    participant LRU as Model Cache
    participant Model as Fashion-CLIP
    database DB as Postgres (pgvector)

    Job->>API: POST /embed (ImageBatch)
    activate API
    API->>LRU: GetModel("fashion_clip")
    activate LRU
    LRU-->>API: Model Instance
    deactivate LRU
    
    API->>API: Preprocess (Resize 224x224, Normalize)
    
    API->>Model: Forward Pass (Batch Tensor)
    activate Model
    Model-->>API: Embeddings (512d Float32)
    deactivate Model
    
    API-->>Job: 200 OK (JSON Vectors)
    deactivate API
    
    Job->>DB: BEGIN Transaction
    activate DB
    Job->>DB: INSERT INTO product_vectors VALUES (...)
    Job->>DB: COMMIT
    deactivate DB
